'''Bows''' is an [[item class]] of two-handed [[ranged]] [[weapons]] that require [[dexterity]] to equip. [[Quiver]]s may be equipped with bows to provide additional bonuses. Bows have low base [[critical strike chance]] but moderate [[physical damage]] and [[attack speed]], resulting in overall higher damage per second than [[wands]].

Bows sometimes do not have implicit [[modifier]]s. There are 5 groups of bow base types (with 3 base types each) with the following implicits:
* {{c|mod|x% increased Elemental Damage with Weapons}}
* {{c|mod|x% increased Critical Strike Chance}}
* {{c|mod|x% to Global Critical Strike Multiplier}}
* {{c|mod|x% increased Movement Speed}} ([[Maraketh weapon]]s)
* {{c|mod|Adds # to # Fire Damage}} ([[Experimented Base Types]])

In additions, all bows are 2 x 4 in size, with the exception of the starter bow and another set of bows. The exception (total 4), are 2 x 3 in size and all without an implicit. 

