==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.17.2|
*Bows in Standard with one-handed local Added Fire, Cold, Lightning and Chaos Damage weapon prefix modifiers can now have a Divine Orb used on them to obtain the two-handed modifier values introduced in 3.17.0.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.17.0|
* Give bows the same local added elemental damage modifiers as two handed melee weapon modifiers do, which are much stronger than the bow-specific modifiers used previously.
* Improve the damage of bows in general, with some base types getting up to 50% more base damage than before.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.8.7|
* Fixed [[bow]] [[attack]]s so that they still do [[damage]] when firing really fast. The [[arrow]] may still be taken away visually.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.8.3|
